title: OpenAI Platform: API collection
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Monitors the authenticated OpenAI Platform API collection itself. The endpoint count represents the set queried by this collector version, not a fixed provider inventory. Authentication/access failures, required endpoint failures and optional endpoint failures have configurable states. API reference: https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference.
discovery: One service is created whenever the openai_platform agent section is present.
